# What NOT to upload when deploying from the CLI.
#
# Without this the CLI packages the whole working directory — 54,984 files and
# several GB — and the deploy is rejected for exceeding 15,000 files. Vercel
# installs dependencies and runs the build itself, so none of the build output
# or vendored material below is needed to produce a deployment.
#
# Everything the build actually reads stays: content/, public/, app/, lib/,
# components/, scripts/ (the build runs seo:generate-llms) and supabase/.

# Rebuilt on Vercel.
node_modules
.next
.vercel

# Local-only research material: site scrapes and imported source documents kept
# on disk for reference. Each is untracked in git and referenced by no code, and
# together they are ~39,000 of the ~45,000 files the CLI was trying to upload.
StudyIB
ThinkIB
markschemehamza
LitCharts
_imported
IB SUBJECT REPORTS
SaveMyExams - Notes

# Static design exports, not imported by the app.
design-handoff

# Scratch output — email previews and similar.
tmp

.git
*.log
.env*.local
